I have what I need. The design:

- **Container:** move the `OWCK` reader/writer into `engine/assets` so the converter and runtime share one definition.
- **Texture payload:** move `texture_format` into `engine/assets` so the runtime can decode real cooked textures. The runtime still never links the importers.
